[00:00.000]But something kept pulling upward
[00:00.895]Something I couldn't explain
[00:02.935]Breaking the surface
[00:05.155]Learning how to breathe again
[00:07.975]Not running from the darkness
[00:09.535]But finding where I begin
[00:11.695]Breaking the surface
[00:13.835]Reaching for the open sky
[00:16.355]I thought I was disappearing
[00:18.095]But I was still alive
[00:20.275]I carried every failure like a weight
